    "created_at": "2016-07-28T18:19:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-28T18:19:09Z",
    "body": "Oh, I see, most of the complexity is in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-ol-element:ordinal-value already. So my above proposal is probably not right.\n\nI also think I understand the OP's concern more. The issue is that \"treat as absent\" here is not meant to be a global thing. It's implicitly saying \"treat as absent for the purposes of calculating the element's value.\" I guess that is not clear, but that's what it's supposed to be saying.\n",
